{"id":"ce272d08b1c31931","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-double-fixed-point.md","title":"A Simultaneous Fixed Point for Two Letters","display":"thm-double-fixed-point — A Simultaneous Fixed Point for Two Letters","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-double-fixed-point","aliases":["89-thm-double-fixed-point"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-double-fixed-point — A Simultaneous Fixed Point for Two Letters","depends_on":["[[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]]","[[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]]","[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-double-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-double-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-double-fixed-point — A Simultaneous Fixed Point for Two Letters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ba460c900107e00\" href=\"?note=4ba460c900107e00\" title=\"89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound\">89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d8c3016a32d17f8\" href=\"?note=6d8c3016a32d17f8\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-algorithm\">89-df-fixed-point-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb03b454c0564b96\" href=\"?note=bb03b454c0564b96\" title=\"89-lem-k4-internal-replacement\">89-lem-k4-internal-replacement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fae50ce87c0c5e77\" href=\"?note=fae50ce87c0c5e77\" title=\"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl\">89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\ne q\">\\(p\\ne q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 都关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 模态化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为字母集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=H,q:=I]\">\\(A[p:=H,q:=I]\\)</span> 表示一次同时结构替换，而非未经说明的顺序替换。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}double\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\exists H,I\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(I)\n\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B))\\setminus\\{p,q\\},\\\\\n&amp;(H\\leftrightarrow A[p:=H,q:=I])\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;(I\\leftrightarrow B[p:=H,q:=I])\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;\\left(\\Box^+((p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land(q\\leftrightarrow B))\n\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+((p\\leftrightarrow H)\\land(q\\leftrightarrow I))\\right)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}double\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\exists H,I\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(I)\n\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B))\\setminus\\{p,q\\},\\\\\n&amp;(H\\leftrightarrow A[p:=H,q:=I])\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;(I\\leftrightarrow B[p:=H,q:=I])\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;\\left(\\Box^+((p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land(q\\leftrightarrow B))\n\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+((p\\leftrightarrow H)\\land(q\\leftrightarrow I))\\right)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104、123（练习 3；本库展开）；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>这是原书第 123 页练习 3 的本库证明。先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(F=H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span>，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=B[p:=F]\">\\(G=B[p:=F]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>；尽管构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 可能含未加盒的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，它插入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的位置都在盒内，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 仍关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 模态化。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(G,q)\">\\(I=H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(G,q)\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=F[q:=I]\">\\(H=F[q:=I]\\)</span>。变量界使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,H\">\\(I,H\\)</span> 都不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\">\\(p,q\\)</span>。\n第一弱方程来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\leftrightarrow A[p:=F]\">\\(F\\leftrightarrow A[p:=F]\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:=I\">\\(q:=I\\)</span> 替换；第二来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\leftrightarrow G[q:=I]\">\\(I\\leftrightarrow G[q:=I]\\)</span>。新鲜性使这些顺序替换等于所写同时替换。\n加强方程如下：dotted-box 保有限合取，把原联合前件拆成两条 dotted 方程。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的加强不动点等价，将第一条换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow F)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow F)\\)</span>。在此前件下，K4 内部替换将第二条中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的加强不动点等价，将其换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow I)\">\\(\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow I)\\)</span>。在后者下再用内部替换把第一条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>，最后合并两条。每次替换都在已有 dotted 方程的作用域内，正反方向同理。\n这给一个总可计算的消元构造；它不额外声称两变量构造也满足单公式的盒子数度数界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound","status":"resolved","id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-k4-internal-replacement","status":"resolved","id":"bb03b454c0564b96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl","status":"resolved","id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\ne q","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=H,q:=I]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}double\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\exists H,I\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(I)\n\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B))\\setminus\\{p,q\\},\\\\\n&(H\\leftrightarrow A[p:=H,q:=I])\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&(I\\leftrightarrow B[p:=H,q:=I])\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&\\left(\\Box^+((p\\leftrightarrow A)\\land(q\\leftrightarrow B))\n\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+((p\\leftrightarrow H)\\land(q\\leftrightarrow I))\\right)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"F=H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"G=B[p:=F]","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"I=H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(G,q)","display":false},{"tex":"H=F[q:=I]","display":false},{"tex":"I,H","display":false},{"tex":"p,q","display":false},{"tex":"F\\leftrightarrow A[p:=F]","display":false},{"tex":"q:=I","display":false},{"tex":"I\\leftrightarrow G[q:=I]","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow F)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow I)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":2688,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"例子与边界：[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase]]、[[89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]、[[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。练习展开：[[89-lem-fixed-point-valuation]]、[[89-thm-double-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["4ba460c900107e00","6d8c3016a32d17f8","85e306b51d3267ec","bb03b454c0564b96","7c0e4d58dc068222","ccac24cdfa254e90","fae50ce87c0c5e77"]}